        "id": 1951687
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-07T18:25:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is a bit of a shame to have to iterate that list all the time. You could just cache the number of pages into kvm_ptdump_guest_state, just like a memcache would do and then you just use a stack.",
      "revId": "27f345ca11f222c3e887ea90fd5364129ddd084d",
